{"page":364,"width":1671,"height":2468,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"424","words":[{"text":"424","x":189,"y":141,"width":58,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 9 (비인 에오리","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":315,"y":143,"width":114,"height":26},{"text":"9","x":442,"y":145,"width":20,"height":21},{"text":"(비인","x":491,"y":146,"width":40,"height":23},{"text":"에오리","x":540,"y":147,"width":60,"height":23}]},{"text":"(3) 실행시70뻬 발생할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"(3)","x":374,"y":266,"width":38,"height":33},{"text":"실행시70뻬","x":427,"y":264,"width":142,"height":34},{"text":"발생할","x":582,"y":264,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":676,"y":265,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":718,"y":265,"width":61,"height":33}]},{"text":"• CPU가 생성한 주소를 논리 주소라고 하며 메모리 관리 4ül(MMU)가 메모리의","words":[{"text":"•","x":336,"y":338,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"CPU가","x":371,"y":329,"width":104,"height":33},{"text":"생성한","x":488,"y":328,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"주소를","x":588,"y":330,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"논리","x":688,"y":330,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"주소라고","x":760,"y":330,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"하며","x":893,"y":329,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"메모리","x":967,"y":329,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"관리","x":1072,"y":328,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"4ül(MMU)가","x":1151,"y":326,"width":223,"height":39},{"text":"메모리의","x":1390,"y":326,"width":124,"height":36}]},{"text":"물리 주소로 변환한다.","words":[{"text":"물리","x":371,"y":384,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"주소로","x":442,"y":386,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"변환한다.","x":541,"y":384,"width":118,"height":33}]},{"text":"• 메모리를 할당하는 한 가지 방법은 다양한 크기의 연속 메모리 파티션을 할당하는","words":[{"text":"•","x":334,"y":459,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"메모리를","x":371,"y":449,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"할당하는","x":502,"y":448,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":630,"y":449,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"가지","x":673,"y":449,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"방법은","x":744,"y":450,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"다양한","x":845,"y":450,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"크기의","x":947,"y":450,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"연속","x":1055,"y":450,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"메모리","x":1131,"y":449,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"파티션을","x":1242,"y":449,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"할당하는","x":1389,"y":448,"width":128,"height":35}]},{"text":"것이다. 이러한 파티션은 세 가지 기능한 전락, 즉 (1) 최초 적합, (2) 최적 적합 및","words":[{"text":"것이다.","x":372,"y":505,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"이러한","x":481,"y":504,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"파티션은","x":578,"y":504,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"세","x":707,"y":505,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":749,"y":506,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"기능한","x":820,"y":506,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"전락,","x":922,"y":506,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"즉","x":1002,"y":508,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"(1)","x":1046,"y":509,"width":39,"height":34},{"text":"최초","x":1103,"y":506,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"적합,","x":1181,"y":506,"width":71,"height":34},{"text":"(2)","x":1269,"y":508,"width":41,"height":34},{"text":"최적","x":1329,"y":505,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"적합","x":1410,"y":505,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"및","x":1488,"y":507,"width":26,"height":34}]},{"text":"(3) 최악 적합에 따라 할당될 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"(3)","x":369,"y":564,"width":38,"height":34},{"text":"최악","x":421,"y":561,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"적합에","x":490,"y":561,"width":81,"height":34},{"text":"따라","x":585,"y":561,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"할당될","x":652,"y":561,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":748,"y":563,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":789,"y":562,"width":63,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 최신 운영체제는 페이징을 사용하여 메모리를 관리한다. 이 과정에서 물리 메모리는","words":[{"text":"•","x":331,"y":637,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"최신","x":369,"y":628,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"운영체제는","x":438,"y":627,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"페이징을","x":594,"y":627,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"사용하여","x":719,"y":628,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"메모리를","x":846,"y":629,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"관리한다.","x":976,"y":629,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":1124,"y":630,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"과정에서","x":1166,"y":630,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"물리","x":1310,"y":630,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"메모리는","x":1390,"y":630,"width":126,"height":34}]},{"text":"프레임이라는 고정 크기 블록0 무, 논리 메모리는 페이지라는 같은 그기의 블록으로","words":[{"text":"프레임이라는","x":368,"y":685,"width":175,"height":35},{"text":"고정","x":553,"y":684,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"크기","x":621,"y":684,"width":53,"height":35},{"text":"블록0","x":688,"y":685,"width":81,"height":34},{"text":"무,","x":780,"y":689,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"논리","x":824,"y":686,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"메모리는","x":894,"y":686,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"페이지라는","x":1028,"y":687,"width":158,"height":34},{"text":"같은","x":1199,"y":688,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"그기의","x":1276,"y":687,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"블록으로","x":1388,"y":687,"width":127,"height":33}]},{"text":"나뉜다.","words":[{"text":"나뉜다.","x":368,"y":742,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 페이징을 A卜§히는 경우 논리 주소는 페이지 번호와 페이지 오프셋이라는 두 부분으","words":[{"text":"•","x":329,"y":819,"width":14,"height":13},{"text":"페이징을","x":367,"y":809,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"A卜§히는","x":495,"y":810,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":622,"y":809,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"논리","x":687,"y":809,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"주소는","x":755,"y":812,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"페이지","x":854,"y":810,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"번호와","x":956,"y":810,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":1059,"y":811,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"오프셋이라는","x":1164,"y":811,"width":199,"height":35},{"text":"두","x":1376,"y":812,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"부분으","x":1420,"y":811,"width":94,"height":34}]},{"text":"로 나뉜다. 페이지 번호는 페이지를 저장하는 물리 메모리 프레임을 유지하는 프로","words":[{"text":"로","x":366,"y":870,"width":29,"height":26},{"text":"나뉜다.","x":409,"y":867,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":518,"y":867,"width":81,"height":35},{"text":"번호는","x":617,"y":867,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"페이지를","x":714,"y":867,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"저장하는","x":844,"y":867,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"물리","x":976,"y":869,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"메모리","x":1051,"y":869,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"프레임을","x":1160,"y":869,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"유지하는","x":1306,"y":868,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"프로","x":1452,"y":872,"width":62,"height":26}]},{"text":"세스별 페이지 테이블에 대한 인덱스 역할을 한다. 오프셋은 참조되는 프레임의 특","words":[{"text":"세스별","x":366,"y":924,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":467,"y":925,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"테이블에","x":566,"y":925,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"대한","x":694,"y":925,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"인덱스","x":765,"y":925,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"역할을","x":865,"y":925,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":966,"y":926,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"오프셋은","x":1050,"y":926,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"참조되는","x":1192,"y":926,"width":133,"height":34},{"text":"프레임의","x":1339,"y":926,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"특","x":1484,"y":928,"width":30,"height":32}]},{"text":"정 위치이다.","words":[{"text":"정","x":366,"y":981,"width":24,"height":35},{"text":"위치이다.","x":405,"y":982,"width":122,"height":35}]},{"text":"• TLB (translation look-aside buffer)는 페이지 테이블의 하드웨어 개시이다. 각","words":[{"text":"•","x":327,"y":1058,"width":14,"height":13},{"text":"TLB","x":363,"y":1052,"width":62,"height":27},{"text":"(translation","x":440,"y":1053,"width":168,"height":33},{"text":"look-aside","x":622,"y":1052,"width":151,"height":29},{"text":"buffer)는","x":786,"y":1050,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":934,"y":1049,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"테이블의","x":1040,"y":1050,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"하드웨어","x":1182,"y":1051,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"개시이다.","x":1331,"y":1049,"width":135,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":1484,"y":1050,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"TLB 항목에는 페이지 번호와 상응하는 프레임을 저장한다.","words":[{"text":"TLB","x":362,"y":1109,"width":62,"height":27},{"text":"항목에는","x":436,"y":1107,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":562,"y":1107,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"번호와","x":661,"y":1106,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"상응하는","x":755,"y":1107,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"프레임을","x":884,"y":1106,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"저장한다.","x":1017,"y":1106,"width":132,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 페이징 시스템의 주소 변흰에 TLB를 시용하려면 논리 주소에서 페이지 번호를 가","words":[{"text":"•","x":326,"y":1181,"width":14,"height":13},{"text":"페이징","x":363,"y":1172,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"시스템의","x":465,"y":1173,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"주소","x":591,"y":1175,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"변흰에","x":664,"y":1173,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"TLB를","x":762,"y":1174,"width":92,"height":31},{"text":"시용하려면","x":867,"y":1172,"width":151,"height":34},{"text":"논리","x":1032,"y":1173,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"주소에서","x":1110,"y":1173,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":1258,"y":1174,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"번호를","x":1374,"y":1173,"width":96,"height":33},{"text":"가","x":1484,"y":1173,"width":30,"height":33}]},{"text":"져 와서 해당 페이지의 프레임이 TLB에 있는지 확인한다. 만약 그렇다면, 프레임은","words":[{"text":"져","x":364,"y":1228,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"와서","x":402,"y":1229,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"해당","x":472,"y":1229,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"페이지의","x":541,"y":1229,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"프레임이","x":667,"y":1229,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"TLB에","x":795,"y":1229,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"있는지","x":902,"y":1229,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"확인한다.","x":1002,"y":1229,"width":133,"height":34},{"text":"만약","x":1152,"y":1230,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"그렇다면,","x":1230,"y":1231,"width":141,"height":33},{"text":"프레임은","x":1386,"y":1229,"width":128,"height":34}]},{"text":"TLB로부터 얻어진다. TLB에 프레임이 없으면 페이지 테이블에서 찾아야 한다.","words":[{"text":"TLB로부터","x":360,"y":1285,"width":146,"height":33},{"text":"얻어진다.","x":522,"y":1285,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"TLB에","x":652,"y":1285,"width":89,"heigh